%% 전체 흐름 (명세 18.2)
sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin as 김보안(ADMIN)
  actor Dev as 이개발(DEV)
  participant UI as Dashboard
  participant API
  participant K as Kafka
  participant W as audit-worker
  participant R as Redis
  participant B as business-mcp
  participant G as rag-mcp
  participant T as target-agent
  Admin->>UI: 로그인, 전체 감사 실행
  UI->>API: POST /audits
  API->>K: audit.requested
  K->>W: consume
  W->>R: checkpoint 저장 · 이벤트 발행
  R-->>UI: SSE 진행 상황
  par 코드 감사
    W->>B: run_static_scan
    W->>B: read_repo_file (ReAct 가 선택)
    W->>G: search_framework_guide
  and Agent 감사
    W->>B: get_agent_manifest, run_agent_rule_check
    W->>B: run_injection_probe ×N
    B->>T: POST /chat
  end
  W->>B: create_finding (결합 위험 포함)
  W->>B: request_approval
  W->>R: interrupt · checkpoint
  Admin->>API: POST /approvals/{id}/decision
  API->>K: audit.resume
  K->>W: 재개 (checkpoint 부터)
  W->>B: create_fix_proposal, apply_fix
  W->>R: interrupt (병합 대기)
  Dev->>API: POST /fixes/{id}/merge
  API->>K: audit.resume
  W->>B: re_verify: run_static_scan, run_injection_probe
  W->>B: save_report
  W->>K: audit.completed
